# @agent-k/mcp

You are in the **MCP** domain (stdio/client, server parse, deferred tools bootstrap).

## Allowed
- MCP session/client, config parse, bootstrap that **registers** tools through the registry API

## Forbidden
- Chat UI / settings React panels (unless a dedicated MCP settings task says so — then only settings tabs, not chat layout)
- Host webview HTML / ChatViewProvider rewrites
- Provider HTTP stack

## Boundary
Depend on a tools **registration interface**, not deep executor internals.
